         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Conclusion\n\nIn this text, we explored how numbers and addition work together. We also learned about axioms, especially the **addition identity**: any number plus zero equals itself.\n\nLike learning to walk, we have taken our first steps in understanding how numbers connect. Each +1 is a small step forward. In the next text, we will keep going and take bigger steps in math.",
               "source": null,
